- Predict the engagement on Instagram posts using features from the post, comments, follower characteristics, and sentiment analysis.
- Use text embeddings from captions combined with engineered features for better prediction.
- Leverage machine learning to build a regression model predicting sentiment-weighted engagement.
- Interpret model predictions using SHAP values.
- Visualize distributions, correlations, and all possible model evaluation metrics.
- Come up with practical implementation like keyword recommendation for this user, or get inputs and predict sentiment weighted engagement or provide suggestions for high sentiment weighted engagement 



